Included (see MANIFEST.md and SHA256SUMS for exact source revisions and hashes):

  bash/kitty.bash
  zsh/.zshenv
  zsh/kitty.zsh
  zsh/kitty-integration
  fish/vendor_conf.d/kitty-shell-integration.fish

Deliberately not included:
  - shell-integration/ssh/* (the Python bootstrap requires Python at runtime)
  - fish completion scripts (they invoke the Python `kitten` executable)
  - zsh `_kitty` completion (it invokes `kitten`)

These scripts are only integrated by kitty's launcher machinery. kitr does not
implement that injection yet. See ../../packaging/README.md for how to source
them manually. No Python is required to run the files shipped here.
